## 1. Trigger — `PowerApps (V2)`

| Input | Type | Name |
|---|---|---|
| File | File | `FileContent` |
| Text | Text | `Country` |
| Text | Text | `ActionedBy` |

A V2 File input arrives as an object, so the bytes are
`triggerBody()?['file']?['contentBytes']` and the original name is
`triggerBody()?['file']?['name']`. Confirm against your first run — the property path depends
on the input's internal name.

